WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.349 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  scarlet nexus is an  original creation from some of the  creative minds behind the much-loved  tales of hesperia it's a stylish  collision of  anime and western sci-fi ideas and  designs  that has birthed an innovative new  sub-genre  brain punk  brain punk can be thought of as the  natural and ultimate outcome of what we  currently dub the internet of things  which is to say that we no longer  require anything so primitive as  physical devices  because everyone's brains are now  connected to the vast  cy net network coinciding with this  major technological development  people started to develop extra sensory  powers  and the world was forever changed  perhaps not so coincidentally  it also marked the appearance of the  others  grotesque hybrids of organic and  man-made objects  with an insatiable hunger for human  brains  this in the game's vaguely defined  timeline  occurred well over half a millennium ago  and for the last 560 years  the other suppression force or osf has  been recruiting psionically gifted  individuals  to suppress the grey mata munching  monstrosities  the others fall from the sky regularly  emerging from a mysterious phenomenon  known as the extinction belt much like  the weather  humanity has figured out how to forecast  these figurative downpours  minimizing civilian casualties while the  osf patrol red zones  on others clean up duty in scarlet nexus  you have the choice of playing as two  recent osf recruits  helping to defend the country of new  himacha  yuito's sumaragi is an optimistic and  energetic boy  whose family has close ties to both the  government and the osf  as a sword specialist he favors close  quarters attacks  which he can combine with powerful  psychokinetic abilities  [Music]  at the other end of the personality  spectrum is kasani randall  a young girl scouted by the osf due to  her best-in-class abilities  in contrast to yuito's optimism kasane  is considered  cold and unapproachable although is  known to be kind  to those who've broken through her tough  exterior  much like her approach to her colleagues  kasane prefers to keep her enemies at a  distance  using ranged multi-blade attacks  alongside her psychokinetic powers  your choice of hero means that you'll  only witness the game's story from their  perspective  and while yuito and kasana's narratives  interweave at key moments throughout  it's only by playing through the game as  both characters  that you'll understand the full picture  but it's not just the pair stories and  play styles that differ  the osf members you party up with change  according to your chosen protagonist too  yuito's first ally is his childhood  friend hanabi ichijo  whose fiery impulsive nature is  reflected in her  aptitude for pyrokinesis in kosane's  branch you'll initially partner up with  shiden  ritter an electrokinesis specialist  thanks to scinet  yuito and cassani can temporarily  receive their allies abilities via sas  also known as the struggle arms system  this brain-to-brain transferal is  visualized by red cables  which if you haven't connected the dots  yet are the eponymous scarlet nexus  in a curious piece of scarlet nexus law  younger brains produce stronger psionic  powers  which has led to many members of the osf  taking anti-aging drugs  to keep their abilities at their peak  this means that the appearance of  certain osf companions  are quite deceptive as you progress  through the story  you'll meet and team up with other  psionic specialists that will gift you  with among  other sas powers hyper speed  invisibility  duplication clairvoyance and  teleportation  you'll have opportunities to chat and  exchange psychic emails to build bonds  with each party member  which will enhance the sas abilities  available to you in combat  you can make your own special connection  to scarlet nexus's unique brain  punk world when it releases on june 25th  [Music]  play it on the all-new xbox

